{"title":"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 40","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The limiting sum of the infinite series\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/0/3e004eea0dcfdfbfa11a2bf62ad8406aee2252be.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{10} + \\frac{2}{10^2} + \\frac{3}{10^3} + \\cdots\\]\" width=\"165\" height=\"37\" />\nwhose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />-th term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/5/5e598a571dc2bdcef75860517e744c38aa72d5ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n/10^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"49\" height=\"20\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/9/899af33e5d3219fea44e950ca2a4112aa483e5f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{9} \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{10}{81} \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{8} \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{17}{72} \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{larger than any finite quantity}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"597\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The series can be written as the following:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/c/0acacd68728a1d1f0f109773608d7abf53bc7e05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{10} + \\frac{1}{10^2} + \\frac{1}{10^3} + ...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"161\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9e32619af6ea8a10c49398a24b46285d680bf42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+ \\frac{1}{10^2} + \\frac{1}{10^3} + \\frac{1}{10^4} + ...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"183\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/8/5e85afbd4622e5a2602bc991d7895a4a58daeb8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+ \\frac{1}{10^3} + \\frac{1}{10^4} + \\frac{1}{10^5} + ...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"183\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>and so on.\n</p><p>by using the formula for infinite geometric series <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/0/e80e0948b751010d90e1e6ad45ef2493135f3c34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{a}{1-r})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"56\" height=\"33\" />,\n</p><p>We can get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/b/48bae85dea957fd52f9e7702f266b6ce2b7de98f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{10}}{1-\\frac{1}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"51\" height=\"47\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cf26be132ef93923e082ee4153b2cb0ef44a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/4/5646793e58d6ba21a20e7c1068e047876819fa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{10^2}}{1-\\frac{1}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"51\" height=\"47\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cf26be132ef93923e082ee4153b2cb0ef44a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3d23d9c3e12e9b5ffe7c30c6baa90c97e7a5b76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{10^3}}{1-\\frac{1}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"51\" height=\"47\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cf26be132ef93923e082ee4153b2cb0ef44a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" /> ...\nSince they all have common denominators, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a230b763bed668f2af7d8859f0fabef0f563ad9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(\\frac{1}{10} + \\frac{1}{10^2} + \\frac{1}{10^3})}{\\frac{9}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"125\" height=\"47\" />.\nUsing the infinite series formula again, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/b/eab899ecfee5df2be893d47fa12870b82c91c818.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{1}{10}}{1-\\frac{1}{10}}}{\\frac{9}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"38\" height=\"56\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/5/025e60d3fe0eb24de95bde109b79db2460da276e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{1}{10}}{\\frac{9}{10}}}{\\frac{9}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"21\" height=\"56\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/8/ff8cc471087f96e493153155c42e0c24d58aa36c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{9}}{\\frac{9}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"19\" height=\"47\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/5/cc54c44d65bb2c3ab52c690c7a206aecf2363d77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ (B) \\frac{10}{81}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"62\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>So.. we have the sum to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/0/710192471b87fd4405d24b83a9a77a2aeb136f78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{10}+\\frac{2}{100}+\\frac{3}{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"136\" height=\"38\" />...\nNotice that this can be written as \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/c/73c5aa2ff2973db4318ad4d268863dde632217dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{10}+\\frac{0.2}{10}+\\frac{0.03}{10}+\\frac{0.004}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"196\" height=\"38\" />.\nNow, it is trivial that the new fraction we seek is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/5/365bccb05f91eff3f6169f4254290803a0ad272f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1.234567891011......}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"156\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Testing the answer choices, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" /> is the correct answer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/0/a10976918f0095358704217321d116dda25c3859.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S = \\frac{1}{10} + \\frac{2}{10^2} + \\frac{3}{10^3} + ...\\]\" width=\"197\" height=\"37\" />\nThen\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/4/fb4091681fb080522a8c1e592f2e7e4aeb3bc424.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10S = 1 + \\frac{2}{10} + \\frac{3}{10^2} + \\frac{4}{10^3} + ...\\]\" width=\"246\" height=\"37\" />\nSubtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/7/60752f8e533048980831bbefd816855746505132.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/a/7baccd4bbc1b73845c2b4d617487857acfbbe549.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, we got:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/a/2fa8f563082e101b0539014984fd06bb0dd229d0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 9S &amp;= 1 + \\frac{1}{10} + \\frac{1}{10^2} + \\frac{1}{10^3} + ... \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{1}{1-\\frac{1}{10}} = \\frac{10}{9} \\\\ S &amp;= \\frac{10}{81} \\end{align*}\" width=\"238\" height=\"129\" />\nTherefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/1/c319fb41f94063111b4e07aa1ad8f5c99d84733b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(B) \\frac{10}{81}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"64\" height=\"49\" />. -nullptr07\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Problem starts at 2:20&#160;: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3PDZtddYQoM&amp;t=5s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3PDZtddYQoM&amp;t=5s</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017163929\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 174/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6627/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:12153:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017163929 and revision id 288520. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}